&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cc12485f6e6d&quot;&gt;Comfortable leading incident coordination, facilitating discussions, documenting decisions, and driving follow-up actions&lt;/p&gt;
