&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;EU Public Affairs Senior Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join the &lt;strong&gt;Public Affairs&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Paris.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an EU Public Affairs Senior Consultant, your mission will be to monitor and analyse EU regulatory developments shaping the future of digital health, and to support Doctolib&#39;s engagement strategy at the European level. You will work closely with the EU Public Affairs Lead to monitor relevant EU policy developments, coordinate internal input and support Doctolib’s engagement with European stakeholders. The role spans a broad and fast-moving regulatory landscape, from AI and health data to cybersecurity, cloud and digital sovereignty, and offers direct exposure to the full public affairs cycle, from monitoring and analysis to stakeholder engagement. The position is based in Paris, with regular travel to Brussels and Strasbourg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor EU legislative and regulatory developments across key policy areas (AI Act, EHDS, GDPR, NIS2, Data Act, cybersecurity and digital sovereignty) and produce timely, actionable analysis for internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the preparation of Doctolib&#39;s positions, consultation responses and contributions to EU institutions and professional associations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organise and follow up on meetings with EU institutions, Permanent Representations and European stakeholders, ensuring proper documentation and follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams, including Legal, Risk and Technology &amp;amp; Product, to foster alignment on EU regulatory topics and translate complex issues into clear, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Doctolib&#39;s engagement with European federations and industry associations, helping to maximise the value of Doctolib&#39;s participation and strengthen its visibility at the European level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Public Affairs colleagues in Germany and Italy on cross-border regulatory priorities and shared engagement strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be our next team mate if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 4 to 5 years of experience in European public affairs, EU policy, European law, international relations or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience in Brussels or Strasbourg: within an EU institution, Permanent Representation, professional federation, consultancy or interest representation organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a solid understanding of EU institutions and EU legislative and decision-making processes, and are comfortable navigating a complex multi-stakeholder environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong analytical, synthesis and drafting skills, with hands-on experience preparing position papers, consultation responses or institutional meeting reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are fluent in both French and English (written and spoken, C1 level or above), with the ability to produce clear and concise content for varied audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Now it would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have initial knowledge of European digital and health legislation, such as the AI Act, EHDS, GDPR, NIS2, the Data Act, MDR/IVDR or European cybersecurity legislation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience in healthcare, digital, technology or another regulated sector, or a good understanding of how European federations and professional associations operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an academic qualification or experience in EU Law&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak an additional European language, particularly German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ParentCare Program: Enjoy full salary coverage (100%) during your first month of birth leave and 75% during the second, covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with your TA Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with the Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with a Senior Leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris, France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week) — regular travel to Brussels and Strasbourg required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Our Channels &amp;amp; Alliances Team’s charter builds and activates a strategic, differentiated and high-impact partner ecosystem for our best-of-breed multi-cloud monitoring product, one partner at a time. As a Senior Partner Manager, you will recruit and develop channel partners that drive new customer adoption and revenue, including Regional and Global Systems Integrators, Managed Service Providers, and Value Added Resellers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and recruit new strategic channel partners to drive revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and activate existing partners through training, planning and joint selling activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate the technical and marketing aspects of integrated partnership launches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host regular business reviews with partners to drive accountability and report on success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with Datadog’s regional enterprise and commercial sales organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate partner-sourced net-new sales pipeline and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in 7+ years of partner-facing, quota-carrying business development, strategic alliances, or channel sales at a cloud services or software as a service organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven in driving sales opportunities from lead generation to closure, effectively negotiating agreements and building long-lasting partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to quickly comprehend technical concepts and architectural scenarios, and explain them to others verbally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in managing premier Cloud MSP partners will be advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel 20-30% of the time&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High income earning opportunities based on self performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSU) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales training in MEDDIC and Command of the Message&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intra-departmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, opportunity to join our Community Guilds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
